 h-4 rounded bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 text-[10px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">F</span>Metode WD</a><a href="#sec-g" class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 text-[12px] font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-brand-600 hover:border-brand-200 shadow-sm"><span class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 text-[10px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">G</span>Payment</a><a href="#sec-h" class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 text-[12px] font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-brand-600 hover:border-brand-200 shadow-sm"><span class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 text-[10px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">H</span>Withdraw</a><a href="#sec-i" class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 text-[12px] font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-brand-600 hover:border-brand-200 shadow-sm"><span class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 text-[10px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">I</span>Status WD</a>
